# TWA / Android APK build (generated by bubblewrap — run from repo root)
#
# Every path here is root-anchored on purpose. Bubblewrap writes its output to
# the repo root, but android-sms-listener/ is a real Android project with its
# own gradle/, gradlew and *.gradle.kts files. Unanchored rules matched those
# too, which silently kept gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar and gradlew.bat
# out of the repo — and a wrapper with no jar cannot run, so the APK workflow
# could never build. Same trap as /app/ below: do not drop these slashes.
android.keystore
/app/
/gradle/
/build.gradle
/settings.gradle
/gradlew
/gradlew.bat
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab

# Generated PWA icons (run: cd frontend && npm run generate-icons)
frontend/public/icons/
